if(typeof require==='function'){var Classy=require('./classy');var Box2D=require('./box2d');var ProjectileState=require('./projectilestate');var Log=require('./log');}var Projectile=Classy.newClass().name('Projectile');Projectile.fields({id:null,playerId:null,type:0,x:0.0,y:0.0,speedX:0.0,speedY:0.0,lifetime:0.0,timeoutWindow:0,timeoutBounceCount:0,b2dbody:null,roundModel:null,timeAlive:0.0,deadlyToOwner:false,initialSpeedSquared:0,initialSpeed:0,stopped:false,bounces:[],evtHandler:null,evtContext:null,log:null});Projectile.constructor(function(projectileState,lifetime,timeoutWindow,timeoutBounceCount,roundModel,evtHandler,evtContext){this.setProjectileState(projectileState);this.timeAlive=0.0;this.lifetime=lifetime;this.timeoutWindow=timeoutWindow;this.timeoutBounceCount=timeoutBounceCount;this.deadlyToOwner=false;this.initialSpeedSquared=this.speedX*this.speedX+this.speedY*this.speedY;this.initialSpeed=Math.sqrt(this.initialSpeedSquared);this.stopped=false;this.bounces=[];this.roundModel=roundModel;this.evtHandler=evtHandler;this.evtContext=evtContext;this.log=Log.create('Projectile');});Projectile.methods({getId:function(){return this.id;},getPlayerId:function(){return this.playerId;},getType:function(){return this.type;},setX:function(x){this.x=x;},getX:function(){return this.x;},setY:function(y){this.y=y;},getY:function(){return this.y;},setSpeedX:function(speedX){this.speedX=speedX;},getSpeedX:function(){return this.speedX;},setSpeedY:function(speedY){this.speedY=speedY;},getSpeedY:function(){return this.speedY;},setB2DBody:function(b2dbody){this.b2dbody=b2dbody;},getB2DBody:function(){return this.b2dbody;},isDeadlyToOwner:function(){return this.deadlyToOwner;},makeDeadlyToOwner:function(){this.deadlyToOwner=true;},getTimeAlive:function(){return this.timeAlive;},setProjectileState:function(projectileState){this.id=projectileState.getId();this.playerId=projectileState.getPlayerId();this.x=projectileState.getX();this.y=projectileState.getY();this.speedX=projectileState.getSpeedX();this.speedY=projectileState.getSpeedY();this.type=projectileState.getType();if(this.b2dbody){this.b2dbody.SetPosition(Box2D.Common.Math.b2Vec2.Make(this.x,this.y));this.b2dbody.SetLinearVelocity(Box2D.Common.Math.b2Vec2.Make(this.speedX,this.speedY));}},getProjectileState:function(){var ps=ProjectileState.withState(this.id,this.playerId,this.type,this.x,this.y,this.speedX,this.speedY);return ps;},update:function(deltaTime){this.timeAlive+=deltaTime;var currentTimeout=new Date().getTime()-this.timeoutWindow;for(var i=0;i<this.bounces.length;++i){if(this.bounces[i]>=currentTimeout){this.bounces.splice(0,i);break;}}if(Math.abs(this.b2dbody.GetLinearVelocity().LengthSquared()-this.initialSpeedSquared)>0.01){var velocity=this.b2dbody.GetLinearVelocity();var length=velocity.Length();if(length===0){this.stopped=true;}else{velocity.Multiply(this.initialSpeed/length);}}this.x=this.b2dbody.GetPosition().x;this.y=this.b2dbody.GetPosition().y;this.speedX=this.b2dbody.GetLinearVelocity().x;this.speedY=this.b2dbody.GetLinearVelocity().y;},hitShield:function(){this.bounces.push(new Date().getTime());},hitMaze:function(){this.bounces.push(new Date().getTime());},done:function(){return this.timeAlive>=this.lifetime||this.stopped||this.bounces.length>=this.timeoutBounceCount;},_emitEvent:function(evt,data){if(this.evtHandler&&this.evtContext){this.evtHandler(this.evtContext,evt,data);}}});if(typeof module==='object'){module.exports=Projectile;}